[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/27886209/9e6265e1a5d4fded5767a96108964b8479ec0754.png[/img]

Insane Robots V1.0.9, out NOW, brings a load of new features, as well as improvements to the two awesome new difficulty modes released recently.

[b]TRICKSY MODE[/b] increases the rate of progression and difficulty with faster unlocks, tougher AIs, higher health cost and more challenging hazards. You can switch it on or off at any time.

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/27886209/9ac5412f860e98de9dd70b5e0e22fda1d9406d35.png[/img]

[b]ROBO-SLAYER MODE[/b] is unlocked after the entire single-player campaign has been completed, and gives super-tough difficulty plus robots that are reset back to bare metal when they die. WARNING: No one has yet completed the game in this mode. We also carried out a major reworking and tuning of all enemy AIs to support the above modes.

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/27886209/e4ccd1c671057cb464d8cce252379587ae411630.png[/img]

Brand new local and friends multiplayer mode [b]MAX THE CASH[/b] brings deeper strategy. It's all about getting the most in-battle cash via cash tokens, big attacks, overkill, and chains - so it's about more than just killing your opponent;

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/27886209/a52f7c14e8ca962468fea5d4b55942169fa6bc0f.png[/img]

Mode select panel for local and friends multiplayer lets you pick between [b]QUICK BATTLE[/b] or [b]MAX THE CASH[/b] 2P modes. You'll see there are some more multiplayer modes coming soon; 

A [b]NEW[/b] robot select panel lets you play against AIs using any robots you have unlocked, including from DLC purchases, Season Pass, Deluxe Edition, multiplayer rank, friends battles, and 1P campaign progression;

A [b]NEW[/b] lock icon on battle robot pedestals so you always know if your opponent has a locked slot, so if you missed them playing a lock token it's OK (community requested feature);

A [b]NEW[/b] equipped item icon in shop's sell panel, so you know if you are selling an item you are currently using (community requested feature);

Online multiplayer robot unlocks are now easier as they occur at lower ranks: 3, 6, 9, etc., 29, 33

Online friends robot unlocks are now easier as they occur at lower friend counts: 1, 3, 5, 7

All this and more in Insane Robots V1.0.9!!!

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/27886209/542b338a00841611ccd78a0763d88f60015ea657.png[/img]
